Bawendi</surname><given-names>MG</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>(CdSe)ZnS Core-Shell Quantum Dots: Synthesis and Characterization of a Size Series of Highly Luminescent Nanocrystallites</article-title><source>J. Phys. Chem. B</source><year>1997</year><volume>101</volume><fpage>9463</fpage><lpage>9475</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="b7-ijms-10-00441"><label>7.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hines</surname><given-names>MA</given-names></name><name><surname>Guyot-Sionnest</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Bright UV-Blue Luminescent Colloidal ZnSe Nanocrystals</article-title><source>J. Phys. Chem. B</source><year>1998</year><volume>102</volume><fpage>3655</fpage><lpage>3657</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="b8-ijms-10-00441"><label>8.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Yu</surname><given-names>WW</given-names></name><name><surname>Peng</surname><given-names>X</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Formation of High-Quality CdS and Other II&#x02013;VI Semiconductor Nanocrystals in Noncoordinating Solvents: Tunable Reactivity of Monomers</article-title><source>Angew. Chemie</source><year>2002</year><volume>41</volume><fpage>2368</fpage><lpage>2371</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="b9-ijms-10-00441"><label>9.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Norris</surname><given-names>DJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Yao</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Charnock</surname><given-names>FT</given-names></name><name><surname>Kennedy</surname><given-names>TA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>High-Quality Manganese-Doped ZnSe Nanocrystals</article-title><source>Nano Lett</source><year>2001</year><volume>1</volume><fpage>3</fpage><lpage>7</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="b10-ijms-10-00441"><l